{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/cbsphiladelphia/posts/according-to-court-records-fbi-agents-discovered-more-than-100-files-containing-/1349133877363117/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/cbsphiladelphia/posts/according-to-court-records-fbi-agents-discovered-more-than-100-files-containing-/1349133877363117/","title":"CBS Philadelphia","description":"According to court records, FBI agents discovered more than 100 files containing child pornography on laptops and drives.","language":"en","text":"## CBS Philadelphia's Post\n\n---\n\n### **CBS Philadelphia**\n\nJuly 23\n\nAccording to court records, FBI agents discovered more than 100 files containing child pornography on laptops and drives.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n65 comments\n\n27 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nDaniel Moix\n\nSo, not a drag queen or a trans person?\n\n* 15w\n\n6\n\nView 1 reply\n\nRoman Chris\n\nTikTok Shapiro hit a trifecta. With two in 4 months.\n\n* 15w\n\n3\n\nDiane O'Rourke Bankus\n\nHe lives in my Township, and this is the first I'm hearing about it.\n\n* 15w\n\nDerwin Davis\n\nThat’s how they do\n\n* 15w\n\n2\n\nMitchell Ebert\n\nHe was good friends with Josh Shapiro too.\n\n* 14w\n\n2\n\nBart Dabm\n\nUsual suspects\n\n* 15w\n\n8\n\nView all 4 replies\n\nAntonio Lightly\n\nmedia.tenor.com\n\n* 15w\n\n3\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nLeslie McHenry Schott\n\new\n\n* 15w\n\nLarry Wagner\n\n* 14w\n\n1\n\nRobert Colajezzi\n\n* 15w\n\n1","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2164.250537985936,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}